		(property "Description" "User/SOS momentary tactile button, 4.5x4.5mm SMD, 2.2N actuation force, 100k cycles. Intended to drive a NINA-B400 GPIO low when pressed, with the nRF52833's internal pull-up enabled in firmware (no external pull-up part needed). Debounce in firmware. NOTE: actuation force and travel should be re-checked for glove/cold-weather use -- this is a rescue device."
			(at 146.05 220.98 0)
			(effects
				(font
